                <note rend="inline" type="source">Treaty Series No. 763</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Additional Protocol Between the United States of
                        America and Other American Republics, Signed at Lima, October 19,
                        1927</hi><anchor n="43" xml:id="d238-f1"/></head>
                <p>The Presidents of the Argentine Republic, Bolivia, the United States of Brazil,
                    Colombia, Costa Rica, Cuba, Ecuador, the United States of America, Guatemala,
                    Haiti, Honduras, Nicaragua, Panama, Paraguay, Peru, the Dominican Republic,
                    Uruguay and the United States of Venezuela, desirous of adding to the Sanitary
                    Convention signed at Habana on November 14, 1924, have appointed as their
                    plenipotentiaries, to wit: <table cols="2" rows="32">
                        <row role="label">
                            <cell rows="3">Argentine Republic:</cell>
                            <cell>Dr. Laurentino Olascoaga</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
